{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 160225, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 107248, "uid": 63428, "type": 4, "title": "7.21 新角评价", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1655903359, "updated_at": 1658361304, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1662572143, "last_at": 1676457256, "comment_count": 180, "status": 1, "summary": "典中典Q＆A：Q：桂花是必点角色吗？A：是的Q：我没有敏攻攻怎么办？A：桂花用攻敏+任意石头也能用。Q：桂花能用爆攻攻吗？A：可以，但不推荐，因为水队接下来会下掉鲁邦。爆攻攻留着给其他六连更好。Q：我", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_781/202/63428/2022/6/11/433208.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_7308/202/63428/2022/6/20/620106.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_9134/202/63428/2022/6/20/55286.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 15, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 46867, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 5, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 160225, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">典中典Q＆A：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Q：桂花是必点角色吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：是的</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：我没有敏攻攻怎么办？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：桂花用攻敏+任意石头也能用。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：桂花能用爆攻攻吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：可以，但不推荐，因为水队接下来会下掉鲁邦。爆攻攻留着给其他六连更好。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：我练了青钢影，还要练桂花吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：要，但你可以暂时不高加，星云开了桂花才会变为必须品。而等你桂花U了之后，青钢影可以正式宣布下班，在这之前可以一直用青钢影。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：桂花能打WB吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：能打，输出大概是六连刀的85%</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：桂花能跨属性斩车吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：问这种问题的人，你的桂花一般都不能跨属性斩车。而能跨属性斩车的人不会问这种问题。</div><div class=\"div-img\">跨属性需要双红攻石头+满配水Raid辅，附魔和魂卡也不能拉下，达到了才可以跨属性斩。</div><div class=\"div-img\">并且对BOSS也有要求，BOSS必须是防御力较高的情况下，桂花对比木队跨属才会有优势，低防BOSS我为什么不用木队跨属呢？</div><div class=\"div-img\">---------------------------------------</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Q：明王是必点角色吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">A：不是，我只建议PVP火队玩家去点火，如果你星云道中想舒服点也可以点，其他人一律不点，因为明王在乱斗非火队排不上号，比她强的太多。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">我反正不点</span></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：明王打星云要点火吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：星云没开，别问，到时候全图加DOT回避率怎么办？跑来找我赔钱，我直接给你一个大嘴巴子。你敢赌她星云不魔改，就点3红至少。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Q：没U明王做队长真的会被删好友吗？</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">A：不会，米拉队长和明王只差100点，可作为替代品。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1379\" data-height=\"781\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_781/202/63428/2022/6/11/433208.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_781/202/63428/2022/6/11/433208.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1512\" data-height=\"7308\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_7308/202/63428/2022/6/20/620106.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_7308/202/63428/2022/6/20/620106.png\"><img data-width=\"1512\" data-height=\"9134\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_9134/202/63428/2022/6/20/55286.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_9134/202/63428/2022/6/20/55286.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></div><br></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">满配水队＆桂花（罗刹队长）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1662\" data-height=\"1687\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1662/h_1687/202/63428/2022/6/1/110704.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1662/h_1687/202/63428/2022/6/1/110704.png\"></div><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1379/h_781/202/63428/2022/6/11/433208.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_7308/202/63428/2022/6/20/620106.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1512/h_9134/202/63428/2022/6/20/55286.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "